/* Rendered equation images (LaTeX -> PNG), linked as RCDATA.
   Mathematical sheets opened in separate windows (EquationViewer.pas):
     Resources\tex\sheet1_membrane.tex ... sheet6_analysis.tex
     (render with Resources\tex\build_sheets.py, then rebuild the project)
   The overview and notation of tab 6 "Model and Equations"
   (Resources\hh_equations.png, Resources\hh_nomenclature.png) are stored in
   Unit1.dfm (imgEquations, imgNomenclature) so that they are visible in the
   Form Designer; after re-rendering them, load the PNG again with
   Picture > Load in the Object Inspector. */
SHEET1_PNG       RCDATA "Resources\\sheet1_membrane.png"
SHEET2_PNG       RCDATA "Resources\\sheet2_gating.png"
SHEET3_PNG       RCDATA "Resources\\sheet3_rk4.png"
SHEET4_PNG       RCDATA "Resources\\sheet4_cable.png"
SHEET5_PNG       RCDATA "Resources\\sheet5_fd.png"
SHEET6_PNG       RCDATA "Resources\\sheet6_analysis.png"
